[[:db/add "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad" :answer/id #uuid "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad"] [:db/add "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/id #uuid "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54"] [:db/add "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/choices "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad"] [:db/add "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/correct "e7dac586-8937-596c-a536-0affac3403ad"] [:db/ensure "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/id #uuid "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32"] [:db/add "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\sin{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}}{4}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/answer-fields "f4725154-97d7-5a06-956a-ad97366aaa54"] [:db/ensure "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "3fa4f0a8-a5a5-599b-b592-922d02da7a32"] [:db/add "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909" :answer/id #uuid "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909"] [:db/add "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}"] [:db/ensure "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/id #uuid "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12"] [:db/add "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/choices "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909"] [:db/add "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/correct "29129c0d-63a1-5fa5-b460-2ac6d96d7909"] [:db/ensure "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/id #uuid "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5"] [:db/add "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 3 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 3 \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=-1,\\quad \\sin{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{3 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}\\right]_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{3}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/answer-fields "a0b4fc06-a427-5181-8a39-38358b25ff12"] [:db/ensure "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "b3ba73e8-b32a-51d2-8418-65a2407941b5"] [:db/add "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72" :answer/id #uuid "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72"] [:db/add "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72" :answer/validate] [:db/add "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/id #uuid "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51"] [:db/add "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/choices "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72"] [:db/add "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/correct "2cc87d46-26e5-5335-bed4-43c798e56f72"] [:db/ensure "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/id #uuid "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11"] [:db/add "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cos{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=-1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}=\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/answer-fields "916ef59f-170f-5229-bd63-8912425b4d51"] [:db/ensure "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "e7a0f050-2946-58fd-95f9-73a790b95c11"] [:db/add "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b" :answer/id #uuid "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b"] [:db/add "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b" :answer/value "\\sin{\\left(4 x + 1 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/id #uuid "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0"] [:db/add "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/choices "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b"] [:db/add "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/correct "69a2fb74-23f1-5254-a978-a04c681a417b"] [:db/ensure "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/id #uuid "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22"] [:db/add "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(4 x + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(4 x + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\sin{\\left(4 x + 1 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/answer-fields "8859f456-f493-52a4-9162-19d42cc493e0"] [:db/ensure "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "c215995a-d0f1-544a-8474-4f4f0eb8af22"] [:db/add "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423" :answer/id #uuid "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423"] [:db/add "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423" :answer/value "- \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(2 x + 1 \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423" :answer/validate] [:db/add "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/id #uuid "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91"] [:db/add "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/choices "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423"] [:db/add "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/correct "449e0e1d-9a6c-5fe1-a95b-b639f4ccd423"] [:db/ensure "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/id #uuid "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59"] [:db/add "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 x + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{3 \\cos{\\left(2 x + 1 \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/answer-fields "63f21da6-ff1f-5651-915c-74c67a35db91"] [:db/ensure "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "0b089ae1-11ab-5fa6-bab3-121d25262e59"] [:db/add "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11" :answer/id #uuid "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11"] [:db/add "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11" :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{3}"] [:db/ensure "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed"] [:db/add "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/choices "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11"] [:db/add "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/correct "db631def-0fa3-54f6-a633-156d28801a11"] [:db/ensure "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/id #uuid "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d"] [:db/add "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=-1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}=\\left(- \\frac{2}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/answer-fields "d26e671a-fc5b-5cf6-9ef2-b441436e52ed"] [:db/ensure "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "2f366558-9e7a-541a-91d0-27b02256448d"] [:db/add "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007" :answer/id #uuid "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007"] [:db/add "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/id #uuid "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106"] [:db/add "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/choices "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007"] [:db/add "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/correct "c7eb6e67-4a18-53d8-ba2a-89bcc5bd5007"] [:db/ensure "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/id #uuid "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd"] [:db/add "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}} 4 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}} 4 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cos{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{4 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi}=\\left(- \\frac{4}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/answer-fields "5be5dc06-c711-5e1b-a9fd-07303d441106"] [:db/ensure "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "809eb303-b9cb-5d30-aed9-c8aaa494c3bd"] [:db/add "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b" :answer/id #uuid "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b"] [:db/add "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sin{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1"] [:db/add "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/choices "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b"] [:db/add "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/correct "e19d6768-369b-5339-b2de-6f778a91814b"] [:db/ensure "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/id #uuid "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f"] [:db/add "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\cos{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/answer-fields "ff3f1e31-a3c3-5586-83f4-993e6c8b7fb1"] [:db/ensure "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "7daabcb8-6802-52c0-8ab2-c2275f358b9f"] [:db/add "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7" :answer/id #uuid "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7"] [:db/add "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/id #uuid "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347"] [:db/add "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/choices "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7"] [:db/add "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/correct "caed2feb-8122-5cc5-b89b-a8b6595154f7"] [:db/ensure "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/id #uuid "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c"] [:db/add "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\sin{\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\pi \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 3 x + 2 \\pi$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\sin{\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\pi \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{2 \\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=1,\\quad \\cos{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{4 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{2 \\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/answer-fields "9aa79387-ab64-5460-8503-123d889a9347"] [:db/ensure "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "25017208-d35a-5987-9f5a-ab92bf702b0c"] [:db/add "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a" :answer/id #uuid "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a"] [:db/add "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a" :answer/value "- \\sin{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/id #uuid "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c"] [:db/add "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/choices "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a"] [:db/add "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/correct "3b8f3487-9d02-53db-b2df-307950d8f96a"] [:db/ensure "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/id #uuid "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6"] [:db/add "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=1 - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\sin{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/answer-fields "161bccb0-aea2-5cb1-8227-a531e572519c"] [:db/ensure "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "740378f5-b137-5bfc-b059-d2ba0149b6e6"] [:db/add "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02" :answer/id #uuid "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02"] [:db/add "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02" :answer/value "\\cos{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/id #uuid "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe"] [:db/add "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/choices "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02"] [:db/add "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/correct "da9f1059-bca3-5e1d-90e1-8e5fd7177e02"] [:db/ensure "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/id #uuid "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9"] [:db/add "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 - 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\cos{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/answer-fields "7616ef13-c8e1-5b1a-912c-99ace8fa3fbe"] [:db/ensure "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "73dcbc4d-33eb-5cf3-92de-a76165754dc9"] [:db/add "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73" :answer/id #uuid "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73"] [:db/add "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/id #uuid "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa"] [:db/add "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/choices "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73"] [:db/add "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/correct "0b154617-635a-52a4-9050-3f953507ee73"] [:db/ensure "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/id #uuid "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39"] [:db/add "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\cos{\\left(- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\cos{\\left(- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n1.\n$$"] [:db/add "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/answer-fields "a5c6d66a-7ebc-5319-82d7-8b948873e5fa"] [:db/ensure "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "f14012b1-ed2c-5fa0-b9bf-7eb929926a39"] [:db/add "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b" :answer/id #uuid "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b"] [:db/add "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/id #uuid "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc"] [:db/add "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/choices "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b"] [:db/add "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/correct "d28d9e19-507c-508e-8f85-ad58d778e94b"] [:db/ensure "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/id #uuid "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661"] [:db/add "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sin{\\left(\\pi - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\pi - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sin{\\left(\\pi - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int_{\\pi}^{0} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=-1,\\quad \\cos{\\left(0 \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}\\right]_{\\pi}^{0}=\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{1}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/answer-fields "226db927-2cc9-5970-ac75-31697172e7bc"] [:db/ensure "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "402346c4-9c74-51a8-b1a6-4f25592d8661"] [:db/