ac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\cos{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "b1ea7b9e-b991-5167-b5b1-21daf4621433" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "b1ea7b9e-b991-5167-b5b1-21daf4621433" :question/answer-fields "10c2d165-f0a9-55e4-acba-8ffba03e2106"] [:db/ensure "b1ea7b9e-b991-5167-b5b1-21daf4621433" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "b1ea7b9e-b991-5167-b5b1-21daf4621433"] [:db/add "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f" :answer/id #uuid "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f"] [:db/add "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{3}"] [:db/ensure "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c"] [:db/add "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/choices "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f"] [:db/add "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/correct "e0901d33-2e89-5f39-add8-8a70956d5f7f"] [:db/ensure "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/id #uuid "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca"] [:db/add "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cos{\\left(\\pi - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\pi - 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cos{\\left(\\pi - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\pi}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\pi}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(- \\frac{1}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/answer-fields "7d3edd1e-c3e5-5543-a37f-9d5e1955e37c"] [:db/ensure "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "196fe2f7-2cc5-56b3-b0b3-c2bc0194f4ca"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "72450c30-c638-5ae3-9c46-6060e83610fe"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/60/60eb257bfec719dad22d40e52d42042fed05f51f7a68e7dd5fe3c56e8354de57/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186678033 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678044 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678049 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678052 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678057 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678064 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678072 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186678076 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 175921